{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"“Well that’s not nice.” She then touches the necklace again. “Why do you say that?”","created_at":"2021-08-05T03:23:44.991000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872681255693586482","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"She looks to the necklace as you touch it. \"Changed.\" She says, simply.","created_at":"2021-08-05T03:39:52.011000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872685311669440562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
