{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"“Nope. Both are Human, like I was supposed to be. But… well, it’s complicated.” She shrugs, then pushes her necklace closer to her chest. “They looked past it to make me a good person, and a cleric of Athena.”","created_at":"2021-08-05T03:52:43.358000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872688546933256232","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
